# ============================================================
# Cloud-Security-Study 忽略规则
# 原则：密钥、隐私、运行时数据、二进制大文件一律不入库
# ============================================================

# ===== 私密配置（绝不提交）=====
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
config.local.*
.aider*

# ===== 密钥与证书（绝不提交）=====
*.pem
*.key
*.pfx
*.p12
id_rsa*
id_ed25519*
.ssh/
*credentials*
*secret*
mnemonic*.txt

# ===== 运行时数据（可能包含 API Key / 交易记录等敏感信息）=====
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.log
crypto-quant/backend/data/

# ===== Python =====
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/

# ===== 编辑器与系统垃圾 =====
.idea/
.vscode/
*.code-workspace
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# ===== 本地草稿 =====
a.c

# ===== 毕业设计 =====
# PPT 和 docx 文件（避免误提交）
*.pptx
*.docx

# 毕业设计：不提交的目录
Graduation-Project/code/
Graduation-Project/models/
